# Normalise line endings in the repository rather than relying on every
# curator's local git config. 04_build.py hashes the raw bytes of records/,
# vocab/ and literature/ into db/build_manifest.json, and reading raw bytes
# bypasses git's own CRLF handling -- so with Git for Windows' default
# core.autocrlf=true, those files check out as CRLF and every input hash in the
# manifest differs from the committed one. The committed TSV snapshots are
# written with an explicit LF terminator, but pinning them here keeps a
# worktree checkout matching the blob as well.
* text=auto eol=lf
